  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deadly and destructive flooding swept through Auckland, New Zealand&apos;s most populated city, on January 27, 2023 after record-breaking rainfall. A local state of emergency has been declared. Thousands of calls for help were received by disaster responders as homes have been flooded, roads washed out, and power outages reported. Your donation will go to vetted nonprofits on the front lines of response and recovery.</narrative>
